    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Quantity",
     "texto": [
      "**Berapa kilo?** asks how many kilos. Unlike English, Indonesian doesn't add an \"s\" to make the plural: **satu kilo apel** can mean \"a kilo of apples\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for something to be weighed",
     "texto": [
      "**Tolong timbang** means \"please weigh (it)\". **Ikat** is a unit for things tied together, such as spinach."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
